   "class": ""
  },
  {
   "text": "LOCKED IN THE PRD, 2026-09-16. Title, description and the technician's narrative, joined by a spaced hyphen, no labels and no semicolons. A separator appears only between two things that are both present, so a line with no narrative ends after the description with no trailing hyphen. Whether a line has a narrative at all depends on Administration, Work Order Settings, Require Tech Story, which is off by default.",
